      "description": "Everything the Pi's journal forwards, via rsyslog -> Alloy syslog intake (192.168.99.41:1514) -> Loki. The host label is set to 'pikiosk' by rsyslog to match the Prometheus device label; the box's actual hostname is still DietPi. Loki retention is 30 days.",
